@host = http://localhost:5000

### 1. Health check - 200
GET {{host}}/

### 2. Danh sách bài tập - 200
GET {{host}}/api/assignments

### 3. Tạo lượt nộp hợp lệ - 201
# @name createSubmission
POST {{host}}/api/assignments/1/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentCode": "SV001",
  "repositoryUrl": "https://github.com/example/sv001-signalr"
}

### 4. Đọc lượt nộp (thay GUID bằng id ở response request 3) - 200
@submissionId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
GET {{host}}/api/submissions/{{submissionId}}

### 5. POST thiếu dữ liệu - 400
POST {{host}}/api/assignments/1/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentCode": "",
  "repositoryUrl": ""
}

### 6. POST bài tập không tồn tại - 404
POST {{host}}/api/assignments/99/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentCode": "SV001",
  "repositoryUrl": "https://github.com/example/sv001"
}

### 7. GET GUID không tồn tại - 404
GET {{host}}/api/submissions/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### 8. SignalR negotiate đúng - 200
POST {{host}}/hubs/submissions/negotiate?negotiateVersion=1

### 9. Sai đường dẫn hub - 404
POST {{host}}/hub/submissions/negotiate?negotiateVersion=1
